// Title: Potential Rcdll.DLL Sideloading
// Rule ID: 6e78b74f-c762-4800-82ad-f66787f10c8a
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.persistence, attack.defense-evasion, attack.privilege-escalation, attack.t1574.001
// Category: image_load
